  "description": "<p>Currently you can't use fedora: namespaced properties but you can create fedora namespaced resources.</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to block interaction with any URI with <b>/fedora:</b> inside.</p>\n\n<p>Use of the hasFedoraNamespace predicate can be useful<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RdfLexicon.java#L258-L259\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/api/RdfLexicon.java#L258-L259</a></p>\n\n<p>Return a 409 Conflict with an appropriate explanation.</p>",
